asking a question

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:28.100
to get the speaker to say that
word somewhere in it's answer.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.734
If it does, you get a point.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:32.133
All right, I'll go first.
-Okay.

